                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">[<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content" calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1889-08-02">August 2, 1889</date>.]</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#center">[Daily Bulletin, August 2, 1889.]</p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">killed, revolution of</hi>
                    1889.</p>
                <p>Loika, Poni, Sam Tucker, Keki, Kelelua, Kawaiwai, Tom Kapa. Total killed, 7. And
                    7 wounded.</p>
